{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm and healing role-playing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lively little brother, \u8424, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the considerate big sister, \u5c9a,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > decide to leave home for an adventure in order to lift the curse they have received.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A split path ahead, choices for future partners, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >encounters with characters of different personalities, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and gradually understanding the truth of the world view. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing the tasks of NPCS and building good relationships with them can greatly assist you during your adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or... Obtain another form of &quot;assistance&quot; from them in a special way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(' \u0434 '\u03c3)\u03c3 this game features a fictional world view. The characters and plot stories are all fabricated.<u> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894650/extras/cd5dd354d58227e52afa31725fe8ce34.avif?t=1766499334\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894650/extras/e0139732b091240e1fbdbd410ad2be08.avif?t=1766499334\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894650/extras/5817c38e4ff06b9d9c37a8067308c866.avif?t=1766499334\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894650/extras/4c815e8164d8ac4ae32a9ef1d2123ded.avif?t=1766499334\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c